<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY HOCKEY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY HOCKEY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of round robin league matches of the Champions Trophy hockey tournament on Tuesday. Pakistan drew with Spain 2-2 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Pakistan - Anis Mohammad 25, Rahim Khan 43</p>
<p>Spain - Victor Pujol 63, Juan Escarre 68.</p>
